<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
    <title>Vježba 9 - Video</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Vježba 9: Video elementi</h1>

    <h3>1. Video stream preko &lt;video&gt; elementa</h3>
    
    <video width="500" controls>
        <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Ne podržava video tag.
    </video>
    
    <p>
        <em>Napomena: Da bi ovo bio tvoj video, moraš ga spremiti u mapu i u 
        dijelu <code>src="..."</code> Naziv (npr. <code>moj-film.mp4</code>).</em>
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>2. Preko YouTube servisa</h3>
    
    <iframe 
        width="560" 
        height="315" 
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LXb3EKWsInQ" 
        title="YouTube video player" 
        frameborder="0" 
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
        allowfullscreen>
    </iframe>

</body>
</html>
